克里米亚战争Crimean War –<br>英国/Russia打</td>\n          <td>是第一场被媒体通过新闻报道和照片广泛报道的战争。</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>1899 to 1902</td>\n          <td>波尔战争The Boer War</td>\n          <td><span class=\"strong\">South Africa with settlers from the Netherlands called the Boers.</span> （荷兰移民-南非-波尔战争）</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>1914–<span class=\"red\">1918</span></td>\n          <td>一战 11.11.11结束</td>\n          <td>\n            1.一战爆发原因:1914奥地利Archduke Franz Ferdinand of Austria被刺杀<br>\n            2.一战后女性贡献，开始有投票权30岁\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>1939—1945</td>\n          <td>二战</td>\n          <td>AIR WWII德国入侵波兰是二战开始 <span class=\"red\">1939会考</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td></td>\n          <td>敦刻尔克大撤退Dunkirk spirit 精神</td>\n          <td>是第二次世界大战初期的英法联军的军事撤退行动</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>1940</td>\n          <td>不列颠之战Battle of Britain<br>英/德空军之战</td>\n          <td>aerial battle between Germany and Britain in the summer<br>（空军-英国和德国-二战）</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td></td>\n          <td>The Battle of Trafalgar</td>\n          <td>Admiral Nelson</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder watermark\" aria-label=\"bottom-right watermark\">\n      <span class=\"bubble-large\"></span>\n      <span class=\"bubble-small\"></span>\n      <span class=\"brand\">小红书</span>\n      <span class=\"from\">From 小红书</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
